# Icon-point text grid (2 × 2)

When a section is **heading + optional intro + 4 unlinked points** and you want something other than cards or a centered one-row band:

Use `IconPointGrid`. Each cell is **icon → heading → description**, left-aligned. No card box, border, or shadow.

## Layout

- **Desktop (`sm+`):** two columns (`grid-cols-2`) — four items read as a 2 × 2
- **Mobile:** single column
- Icon on top, then title, then description — **left-aligned**, top-aligned
- Tight title→description (`mb-0.5`)
- No connecting line, no step numbers

## When to use which

| Shape | Component |
|---|---|
| 4 unlinked icon + title + desc, text grid | `IconPointGrid` (P-14) |
| 3 or 5 unlinked points, one centered row | `IconPointBand` (P-06) |
| 4 boxed / compact specs | `InfoCard` (P-07) — only if the previous section is not cards |
| 4 items with per-item links | P-05 cards |
